# StepOne Career - Environment Variables Configuration
# SECURITY NOTE: Variables prefixed with VITE_ are bundled into the public frontend.
# NEVER add VITE_ prefix to secret keys (OPENAI_API_KEY, STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY).
# Configure server-side secrets solely in Supabase Edge Function Secrets (`supabase secrets set ...`).

# 1. Supabase Backend (Public URL & Anon Key with RLS enabled)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...

# 2. Stripe Checkout Payment Links (Web checkout)
VITE_STRIPE_MONTHLY_URL=https://buy.stripe.com/your_monthly_link
VITE_STRIPE_LIFETIME_URL=https://buy.stripe.com/your_lifetime_link

